/T (Finally, we extend our gratitude to those who contributed, and to what made that contribution possible. What appears here is only a surface, what sustains it continues somewhere else. If there is anything to take away from this issue, it is perhaps this: what we recognise as choice is rarely where things begin and instead, is merely a point where they become visible.)
/E (Finally, we extend our gratitude to those who contributed, and to what made that contribution possible. What appears here is only a surface, what sustains it continues somewhere else. If there is anything to take away from this issue, it is perhaps this: what we recognise as choice is rarely where things begin and instead, is merely a point where they become visible.)
/Pg 13 0 R
